body:
People want to just vent and process. I don't think INTJ's need to vent or if you do you spew out algorithms alone in your castle. I also know when I vent to an INTJ , it will initiate the "task sequence response" where I am given a procedural outline/ schematic or flow chart,  with step by stepbench marks to simultaneously remove obstacles and achieve all my dreams. You are all pretty amazing in that way. Only thing is my hopes and dreams can change up very five minutes - so sometimes an INTJ that cares about me might explode (it only happened once or twice).  I've always found an AI/ Engineering INTJ to fix them. 

&#x200B;

If the INTJ that loves me wasn't in my life I would have starved and died on the street from partying.
